{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年38歲的歌手譚嘉儀（Kayee）日前於印尼峇里島舉行盛大婚禮，正式步入人生新階段。連日來她於社交平台陸續發布多段婚禮花絮，向網民分享充滿熱情與浪漫的婚禮點滴。</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀峇里成婚。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186264841208336384297381.png/JPOvzEj3NQQThznAByCgumfInpG4JUxNUDghulA4Ibo\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀峇里成婚。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><p>新郎霸氣拗腰激吻</p><p>在風光明媚的無敵海景見證下，身穿純白婚紗的譚嘉儀與丈夫於絕美花卉佈置前舉行戶外婚禮。全場最吸睛的一幕，莫過於二人情深一吻的震撼瞬間——新郎大展霸氣與熱情，單手托住愛妻纖腰，以極高難度姿勢錫到譚嘉儀向後拗腰，上演一幕猶如偶像劇般的狂熱激吻；此時身後同步噴發出七彩繽紛的煙霧特效，畫面張力十足。</p><figure><img alt=\"新郎錫到譚嘉儀向後拗腰。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186264838494490624352687.png/5vhXMr9DHwXgeRgnKwEFg_4Y3S2ByAUp8pru-vKa7vo\"/><figcaption>新郎錫到譚嘉儀向後拗腰。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好浪漫！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186264857180639232243758.png/lxXjFBIMuXV2jRz8gzJJ_uz6DBwl9sIvZx9R9GcfUfQ\"/><figcaption>好浪漫！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><p>大露背魚尾裙現身派對</p><p>入夜後的婚宴同樣驚喜不斷。譚嘉儀先是換上一襲緊身大露背魚尾裙，盡顯玲瓏曲線，與新郎於台上深情共舞；隨後的狂歡派對中，她再換上閃爍短裙，在強勁音樂與璀璨燈光下與賓客盡情熱舞，場面High爆。</p><figure><img alt=\"大露背禮服跳舞。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186264847344472064902185.png/FKpvwzxKt-pDsY4jmUDfKFPOYtzr8Z6WbqRr2m6ka9o\"/><figcaption>大露背禮服跳舞。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好幸福的笑容！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186264849806659584609321.png/nX0XvyCY9_AQBXqfp0SSVQ5T4hxnTr0USEhS2khIUto\"/><figcaption>好幸福的笑容！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀換上短裙現身After Party。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186264854722646016568739.png/pifyf0fcqj6CPt8zmbu9Hl-7s9P6KODO9RqC_fUagv0\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀換上短裙現身After Party。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"After Party好High。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186264852340150272243865.png/JciJGup3hUVJQ2mGFIxwIXwFapVvmW-tdKhwc3SocHM\"/><figcaption>After Party好High。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T03:38:29.402615+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":510,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}